      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَرَّمٌ</span></b>  <i>Slit,</i> or <i>rent, in several places:</i> so in a
trad., where it is said, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَجَآءَهُ بِمُصْحَفٍ مُشَرَّمِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَطْرَافِ</span> [<i>And he brought him a copy of the
Kur-án having the extremities slit,</i> &amp;c.]. (TA.)
